{"chunk_id": "c1c1091b6c05", "text": "On the night of Victor and Elizabeth\u2019s wedding, a violent storm rises over the lake, mirroring Victor\u2019s dread of the Creature\u2019s threat: \u201cI shall be with you on your wedding night.\u201d Expecting a personal attack, Victor arms himself and patrols the inn, but the danger falls instead on Elizabeth. Her sudden scream leads Victor to the room where he finds her murdered, bearing the mark of the Creature\u2019s grasp. The monster briefly appears at the window, grinning and pointing at the corpse before escaping across the lake. The tragedy cascades: Victor\u2019s father dies from the shock, Victor is imprisoned as a madman, and his life collapses into isolation. Emerging from grief and confinement, he resolves on a single purpose\u2014revenge\u2014and begins the obsessive pursuit of the being he created.\nOn his wedding night the monster murders Elizabeth, Victor\u2019s father soon dies of grief, and Victor vows revenge and begins a futile appeal to authorities.\nThemes: revenge, loss and grief, consequences of creation, isolation, madness vs justice", "vector": [0.006253497209399939, -0.022772356867790222, 0.0008463813574053347, -0.00886104442179203, -0.0015493641840294003, 0.021150467917323112, -0.014966198243200779, -0.0050041163340210915, 0.0005674134008586407, -0.02150649204850197, 0.002080103848129511, 0.03723748400807381, -0.0021130689419806004, -0.00689631886780262, 0.015084872953593731, 0.01991097815334797, 0.04245917126536369, -0.013008065521717072, 0.02961593121290207, -0.02612162008881569, 0.00266853254288435, 0.0031349901109933853, 0.01077961828559637, 0.00948738306760788, -0.02103179320693016, -0.019805489107966423, 0.009995047003030777, -0.020794443786144257, 0.025726037099957466, -0.00715344725176692, -0.012764123268425465, -0.015651874244213104, -0.009619243443012238, -0.01993734948337078, -0.03615622594952583, 0.004641499370336533, -0.004084387794137001, -0.01915937103331089, 0.01068072300404310